WEBVTT

00:16.640 --> 00:17.670
Do you recognize

00:19.480 --> 00:20.440
what this is?

00:39.600 --> 00:40.240
Changqing!

00:40.670 --> 00:41.200
Guards,

00:41.210 --> 00:42.640
- Prince Xin is unwell.
- Changqing!

00:42.640 --> 00:44.016
- Escort him back to his palace.
- Your Highness!

00:44.200 --> 00:45.070
Calm down.

00:45.470 --> 00:46.790
- Restrain him!
- Tell me now!

00:46.790 --> 00:47.520
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

00:47.520 --> 00:48.030
Changqing!

00:48.030 --> 00:49.150
Who are you?

00:49.150 --> 00:50.320
- Your Highness!
- Changqing!

00:51.920 --> 00:53.320
Who are you?

00:53.320 --> 00:54.030
Changqing!

00:56.280 --> 00:58.470
Tell me, who are you?

02:19.140 --> 02:19.952
=Blossoms of Power=

02:19.952 --> 02:22.740
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:22.820 --> 02:25.780
=Episode 10=

02:27.470 --> 02:28.080
Your Majesty,

02:28.624 --> 02:29.630
I was shocked to realize

02:30.448 --> 02:32.520
that Commandery Princess Zhaoning
and my late wife

02:33.310 --> 02:34.560
share many similarities.

02:37.280 --> 02:38.640
Changqing, watch your words.

02:39.040 --> 02:41.310
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is exceptionally intelligent.

02:41.310 --> 02:42.848
What's difficult about making incense?

02:43.312 --> 02:45.040
Are you suggesting
that in the entire world,

02:45.072 --> 02:46.840
only your wife was an incense master?

02:47.072 --> 02:49.240
Ladies from noble families
conduct themselves with grace.

02:49.590 --> 02:51.150
Tapping one's fingers while in thought

02:51.150 --> 02:52.960
is just a common mannerism
among young women.

02:53.150 --> 02:54.528
It's hardly unique to your wife.

02:55.710 --> 02:58.680
As for the talk of two moons in the sky
and the star gate opening,

02:58.816 --> 03:01.470
even the Observatory Official
can't explain the reason behind it.

03:01.870 --> 03:02.750
For you to use

03:02.750 --> 03:05.120
such a mystical and unprovable event
as evidence

03:06.470 --> 03:08.080
is far too forced.

03:12.310 --> 03:13.750
Changqing,

03:14.190 --> 03:15.400
your wife

03:16.000 --> 03:17.470
passed away three years ago.

03:17.960 --> 03:18.960
Could it be

03:19.120 --> 03:20.800
that in your deep longing for your wife,

03:21.360 --> 03:22.630
your mind has become unsettled?

03:27.408 --> 03:29.296
I would like to ask
the Commandery Princess

03:30.470 --> 03:31.960
to clear my doubts herself.

03:32.304 --> 03:33.800
You have long resided in northwest.

03:34.360 --> 03:36.470
How did you know
about that secret mountain path?

03:40.150 --> 03:40.800
Your Majesty.

03:43.080 --> 03:44.120
It seems at this point,

03:44.870 --> 03:46.030
I can no longer hide it.

03:47.680 --> 03:48.710
I admit

03:50.120 --> 03:51.430
that Prince Xin's Consort and I

03:51.560 --> 03:53.680
were close friends who had never met.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.470
What?

03:54.710 --> 03:56.030
Close friends?

03:56.496 --> 03:57.840
Allow me to explain, Your Majesty.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.680
The year I came of age,

04:00.120 --> 04:02.190
my brother, Shen Yun'an,
was ordered to the capital.

04:02.590 --> 04:04.150
Seeing how much I missed my brother,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.240
my father gave me a carrier pigeon

04:06.430 --> 04:08.630
so I could correspond with him.

04:08.720 --> 04:10.384
Unexpectedly, the pigeon was injured

04:10.464 --> 04:13.560
and fell into the home
of a young lady in the imperial capital.

04:13.568 --> 04:15.456
After she nursed the pigeon
back to health,

04:15.750 --> 04:17.390
she had it send a message back to me.

04:17.630 --> 04:18.750
I wrote back to thank her.

04:19.160 --> 04:20.270
Through this exchange,

04:20.390 --> 04:22.640
we became close friends
who communicated only by letter.

04:22.680 --> 04:23.830
That young lady

04:24.800 --> 04:26.240
was Prince Xin's Consort.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.070
Indeed.

04:27.070 --> 04:27.680
Impossible.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.720
I've never heard of this.

04:30.510 --> 04:32.630
Qingzhi told me stories
of the imperial capital,

04:32.950 --> 04:34.600
and I told her about life in northwest.

04:34.610 --> 04:36.260
We both had a passion
for blending incense.

04:36.270 --> 04:38.990
The secret mountain path and the
method for making Jati flower incense

04:39.040 --> 04:41.160
were things Qingzhi told me about
in her letters.

04:41.728 --> 04:43.390
After she married
into Prince Xin's Manor,

04:43.680 --> 04:45.390
our correspondence gradually lessened.

04:45.632 --> 04:47.040
It was only later that I learned

04:47.390 --> 04:48.600
of her unfortunate passing.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.750
I was deeply grieved.

04:53.616 --> 04:55.936
Changqing,
do you have anything else to say?

04:57.630 --> 04:58.560
Zhaoning,

04:58.720 --> 05:00.390
this has all been a misunderstanding.

05:01.240 --> 05:02.870
Please don't take it to heart.

05:03.310 --> 05:05.430
Prince Xin did not harm me.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.480
I am willing to let the matter rest.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.984
Now that everything
has been cleared up today,

05:10.560 --> 05:12.040
I hope Prince Xin

05:12.390 --> 05:14.360
will abandon that incredible delusion

05:15.040 --> 05:16.310
and stop chasing shadows.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.310
Do you know

05:19.104 --> 05:21.456
that even if the person hidden deep
in your heart

05:21.750 --> 05:23.040
changes their appearance,

05:24.800 --> 05:26.270
they will eventually be recognized?

05:27.920 --> 05:29.870
Your deep love for your wife

05:29.950 --> 05:31.000
is admirable.

05:32.272 --> 05:34.120
But if this longing
has turned into an illness,

05:34.272 --> 05:36.112
perhaps it would be better
to live in seclusion

05:36.144 --> 05:37.776
to recuperate and cultivate your mind.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.390
so as not to disturb others again.

05:40.950 --> 05:41.870
Changqing,

05:42.070 --> 05:43.190
if there is any more

05:43.600 --> 05:45.310
improper conduct,

05:45.310 --> 05:45.720
I...

05:47.680 --> 05:49.190
will surely punish you severely.

05:53.312 --> 05:55.040
Please forgive me, Commandery Princess.

06:00.160 --> 06:01.190
Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:14.870 --> 06:15.830
Your Highness.

06:21.568 --> 06:23.190
There is one thing I don't understand.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.560
I'd like to ask you about it.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.630
What is it?

06:26.928 --> 06:28.480
Qingzhi had a proud and aloof nature.

06:29.000 --> 06:30.360
She rarely socialized with anyone.

06:31.510 --> 06:33.480
Why was it
that she was only close to you?

06:34.160 --> 06:35.040
I don't want to say.

06:38.310 --> 06:38.870
Fine.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.480
Then I won't ask again.

06:44.032 --> 06:45.360
Let's go to my temporary palace.

06:45.390 --> 06:47.180
I had Tian Yuan
prepare some wild game dishes.

06:47.190 --> 06:48.240
Please have a taste.

06:48.448 --> 06:49.952
You're not going to ask anymore?

06:50.704 --> 06:51.830
If you don't wish to say,

06:51.950 --> 06:53.232
then I have no right to pry.

06:53.870 --> 06:55.510
Everyone has their own secrets.

06:56.270 --> 06:57.920
We aren't even engaged yet.

06:58.160 --> 06:58.920
Even if we were,

06:58.976 --> 07:00.752
I couldn't interfere
in your private affairs.

07:00.784 --> 07:02.624
And I certainly have no right
to question you.

07:02.630 --> 07:04.120
Your way of thinking

07:04.560 --> 07:06.560
is quite different from other men
in the world.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.160
A marriage contract

07:08.600 --> 07:09.830
gives a husband

07:09.872 --> 07:12.128
the privilege of helping his wife
with her troubles,

07:12.630 --> 07:14.680
not the right to interfere
with her thoughts.

07:14.816 --> 07:15.920
Whether it's an engagement

07:16.360 --> 07:17.510
or a future marriage,

07:18.064 --> 07:19.920
it should not become a restraint
on a lady.

07:23.720 --> 07:24.360
After you.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.800
Xihe, how are you?

07:35.800 --> 07:38.390
Are you hurt? I've been searching
for you all night with my guards.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.480
I'm fine.

07:39.480 --> 07:40.430
Completely unharmed.

07:43.024 --> 07:44.870
I was the one
who took you horseback riding.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.390
And I failed to look after you.

07:46.704 --> 07:48.170
If anything had really happened to you,

07:48.180 --> 07:50.030
I would've regretted it
for the rest of my life.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.000
Young Master Bu,

07:51.120 --> 07:53.390
don't listen to Her Highness
making it sound so trivial.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.160
You have no idea how dangerous it was.

07:55.560 --> 07:57.600
It was all thanks
to the Crown Prince's help.

07:57.600 --> 07:58.480
The Crown Prince?

07:58.950 --> 08:00.390
With how frail he is?

08:00.390 --> 08:01.160
I don't believe it.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.160
What's wrong with being frail?

08:03.160 --> 08:04.080
Being strong and robust

08:04.090 --> 08:06.040
is useless if one is unwilling
to protect his wife.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.330
Although Crown Prince
is physically weak,

08:07.344 --> 08:08.912
he risked his life to help Her Highness.

08:08.920 --> 08:10.240
He is a true gentleman.

08:13.168 --> 08:15.360
How is the search for the live bees
I asked you to find?

08:15.456 --> 08:18.496
You only care about requesting live bees
to treat Crown Prince's eye ailment.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.390
It seems

08:19.560 --> 08:21.190
this marriage is settled.

08:30.310 --> 08:30.870
Your Highness,

08:31.310 --> 08:33.750
this matter of the star gate
may sound mysterious,

08:34.390 --> 08:37.030
but Prince Xin has always been
cautious and prudent.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.960
How could he lose his composure
over such a legend?

08:40.120 --> 08:40.840
Besides,

08:41.150 --> 08:43.360
this concerns the Commandery Princess's
true identity.

08:44.016 --> 08:45.008
Since you intend

08:45.040 --> 08:47.030
for her to be the Crown Princess
of the East Palace,

08:47.390 --> 08:48.030
shouldn't you

08:48.390 --> 08:49.510
investigate this thoroughly?

08:52.750 --> 08:53.840
When I first met her,

08:54.670 --> 08:56.000
she was Shen Xihe.

08:57.320 --> 08:59.030
Regardless of
whether the star gate exists,

09:00.630 --> 09:02.030
since my heart belongs to her,

09:02.560 --> 09:04.080
if she doesn't want to talk about it,

09:04.440 --> 09:05.630
I will not pry.

09:12.270 --> 09:13.360
Think carefully again.

09:13.824 --> 09:16.368
Did your elder sister
and Commandery Princess Zhaoning

09:16.976 --> 09:18.544
have any sort of friendship?

09:19.510 --> 09:20.270
Brother-in-law,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.240
my sister never treated me,

09:22.240 --> 09:23.510
the daughter of a concubine,

09:24.000 --> 09:25.200
as a real sister.

09:26.200 --> 09:27.480
She always ignored me.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.480
I know very little about her.

09:30.750 --> 09:32.000
Are you sure you never saw

09:32.790 --> 09:34.270
her receive letters from northwest?

09:36.320 --> 09:37.360
I never saw any.

09:48.144 --> 09:50.624
How could you mistake
Commandery Princess for Gu Qingzhi?

09:50.720 --> 09:51.480
How insolent.

09:52.368 --> 09:54.672
Do not address your fifth sister-in-law
by her given name.

09:54.910 --> 09:55.600
I know.

09:56.288 --> 09:58.670
You're trying to find out if your wife
and Commandery Princess

09:58.670 --> 10:00.000
really corresponded by letter.

10:00.800 --> 10:03.080
Do you really think
Commandery Princess is your wife?

10:03.080 --> 10:03.870
What?

10:05.870 --> 10:07.030
Are you trying to stop me?

10:08.000 --> 10:09.360
I have to stop you.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.480
What are you going to do?

10:21.360 --> 10:22.510
Then you'll have to kill me.

10:29.630 --> 10:30.620
Have you gone mad?

10:30.630 --> 10:32.980
I thought you were drowning
in sorrow over your wife's death

10:32.990 --> 10:33.808
and hadn't moved on.

10:33.840 --> 10:34.750
But now it seems

10:34.960 --> 10:36.480
you clearly want to lock yourself away

10:36.480 --> 10:37.680
for the rest of your life!

10:46.120 --> 10:47.270
I have lost my mind.

10:50.360 --> 10:52.550
The woman I loved most has left me,

10:54.910 --> 10:56.480
but everyone around me

10:57.870 --> 10:59.840
is forcing me to act
as if nothing happened.

11:07.390 --> 11:08.240
They say,

11:09.390 --> 11:11.670
"A man lost in love is useless
for greater things."

11:12.240 --> 11:13.150
They say,

11:13.344 --> 11:15.552
"A great man need not worry
about finding a wife."

11:16.000 --> 11:17.870
"Just find another suitable woman."

11:19.030 --> 11:20.240
But has anyone

11:21.270 --> 11:22.600
ever understood my pain?

11:34.320 --> 11:35.670
I know your pain.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.720
But Commandery Princess
is not your wife.

11:40.440 --> 11:42.000
Your obsession is just an illusion.

11:43.390 --> 11:44.960
I'm begging you, let yourself go.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.270
Please?

12:03.240 --> 12:04.510
I will never give up.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.720
- It's Crown Prince.
- Changqing.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.440
Your Highness.

12:38.150 --> 12:39.120
Greetings, Changqing,

12:39.670 --> 12:40.200
Changying.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.600
Why are you here, Your Highness?

12:46.480 --> 12:48.200
This place is hidden in a bustling city,

12:48.360 --> 12:49.600
a quiet and peaceful corner.

12:50.150 --> 12:52.750
It's a perfect place to hide a mistress.

12:57.920 --> 13:00.400
Secretly hiding the descendant
of a convicted official.

13:01.200 --> 13:03.150
Changqing, you truly are audacious.

13:06.600 --> 13:08.480
Father has always held you
in high regard.

13:09.030 --> 13:09.960
Over the years,

13:09.984 --> 13:12.016
you've learned a great deal
about the art of ruling.

13:12.048 --> 13:14.440
Coupled with your exceptional
intelligence since childhood,

13:14.576 --> 13:16.240
in the eyes of the court officials,

13:16.240 --> 13:18.100
you are the candidate for Crown Prince
that Father has groomed

13:18.112 --> 13:18.800
for over a decade.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.550
If Gu Qingshu were to be exposed,

13:20.550 --> 13:21.270
tell me,

13:21.936 --> 13:24.670
wouldn't the noble families
and officials backing the other princes

13:25.000 --> 13:26.720
all rise up and attack you?

13:27.670 --> 13:28.320
What?

13:29.424 --> 13:30.600
You want to get rid of me?

13:31.720 --> 13:33.120
I don't want your life.

13:34.790 --> 13:36.120
I just want you to stop

13:36.480 --> 13:38.080
bothering
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.790
This is just a small request.

13:42.480 --> 13:44.240
I hope you'll consider it seriously.

14:02.864 --> 14:05.312
How could Crown Prince know
about Gu Qingshu's existence?

14:05.440 --> 14:06.670
I was careless.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.080
However, through this,

14:10.000 --> 14:11.840
I've seen his true colors.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.790
It's not a total loss.

14:14.870 --> 14:15.720
Are you saying

14:16.600 --> 14:17.550
he's faking his illness?

14:17.550 --> 14:19.240
I don't think he's faking it.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.320
But he must have his own sources
of intelligence in the court.

14:22.790 --> 14:24.120
Our every move

14:24.960 --> 14:26.270
is under his control.

14:28.048 --> 14:29.550
I had considered that the Crown Prince

14:29.790 --> 14:31.840
might be someone
who hides his true abilities.

14:32.750 --> 14:34.120
But I never expected that

14:34.208 --> 14:36.400
while he was alone
and away from the capital,

14:36.960 --> 14:38.360
he could weave

14:38.910 --> 14:40.870
such a large and intricate web.

14:43.030 --> 14:43.840
Then, Changqing,

14:44.208 --> 14:45.320
what do you plan to do?

14:46.160 --> 14:48.560
The Crown Prince may be powerful enough
to stir up storms,

14:52.240 --> 14:53.670
but he cannot threaten

14:54.910 --> 14:56.030
me, Xiao Changqing.

15:00.864 --> 15:03.264
I switched out the descendant
of a convicted official.

15:03.296 --> 15:04.512
My crime is unforgivable.

15:05.040 --> 15:06.650
I ask for your severe punishment,
Father.

15:06.910 --> 15:08.550
It's been so long.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.440
You're only just now remembering
to confess to me?

15:11.550 --> 15:12.360
Shu...

15:13.550 --> 15:14.870
has reached marriageable age.

15:15.616 --> 15:17.510
If I were to keep her hidden
for her entire life,

15:18.750 --> 15:20.080
I'm afraid Qingzhi would resent me

15:20.090 --> 15:21.568
for not taking good care of her sister.

15:21.630 --> 15:23.720
Today, I've dared to bring her
before you, Father.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.080
For all my crimes,

15:25.344 --> 15:27.248
I am willing to bear the consequences.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.080
Changqing,

15:38.630 --> 15:41.790
I know that you are grieving the loss
of your beloved wife

15:42.550 --> 15:44.200
and your heart is still heavy.

15:46.390 --> 15:49.360
Since you dared
to save Second Young Lady Gu,

15:50.440 --> 15:51.750
it is my will

15:52.960 --> 15:54.630
to bestow her upon you.

15:55.552 --> 15:56.630
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:56.630 --> 15:57.270
- Father,
- I...

15:57.600 --> 15:59.080
Shu is my wife's younger sister.

15:59.550 --> 16:01.240
I have always regarded her
as my own sister.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.550
Qingzhi passed away not long ago.

16:03.960 --> 16:06.240
I am not yet willing to remarry
or take a concubine.

16:07.670 --> 16:08.670
Fine.

16:09.030 --> 16:10.480
Then I won't force you.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.390
Thank you, Father.

16:14.840 --> 16:15.790
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:17.420 --> 16:20.140
(Prince Xin's Manor)

16:20.440 --> 16:22.600
This is the second time
you've saved my life.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.440
I truly don't know

16:24.910 --> 16:26.360
how to repay you.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.872
It was His Majesty who pardoned you.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.720
Besides,

16:30.480 --> 16:32.000
I didn't do this for you,

16:32.320 --> 16:33.360
nor do I need to be repaid.

16:33.600 --> 16:34.550
No, Brother-in-law.

16:36.630 --> 16:39.240
Since childhood, I have never
been doted on by my elders.

16:40.150 --> 16:41.370
After the Gu family's downfall,

16:41.390 --> 16:42.480
it was under your protection

16:42.720 --> 16:44.150
that I was lucky enough to survive.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.440
If you wouldn't mind,

16:46.030 --> 16:47.910
I am willing to serve you
in my sister's place.

16:47.910 --> 16:48.870
I look after you

16:49.720 --> 16:51.720
because you are Qingzhi's
only living relative.

16:51.952 --> 16:53.120
There is no other reason.

16:54.030 --> 16:54.670
Also,

16:56.510 --> 16:57.630
you must remember this.

16:59.670 --> 17:00.910
There is no one in this world

17:02.440 --> 17:03.750
who can replace Qingzhi.

17:06.704 --> 17:08.240
I'll have someone escort you back.

17:15.720 --> 17:17.070
No one can replace her?

17:20.128 --> 17:21.968
What about Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

17:27.460 --> 17:30.860
(East Palace)

17:34.030 --> 17:35.400
Your Highness, how are

17:35.510 --> 17:36.590
your eyes feeling?

17:37.712 --> 17:39.680
Although I still can't
distinguish colors,

17:40.310 --> 17:41.640
the stinging and dryness

17:42.160 --> 17:42.960
have improved a lot.

17:58.680 --> 17:59.720
Since we are now allies,

18:00.310 --> 18:01.350
I won't be a stranger.

18:01.824 --> 18:03.104
Thank you for your trouble.

18:21.880 --> 18:26.390
♪If not for the chirping
of a few insects♪

18:29.320 --> 18:35.430
♪In the warm days, a gentle breeze
blows open the blossoms on a tree♪

18:36.290 --> 18:39.530
♪How else would I think of someone?♪

18:39.780 --> 18:42.890
♪A faint taste of longing on my lips♪

18:43.410 --> 18:45.480
♪Like a thousand twists and turns♪

18:45.480 --> 18:50.410
♪Gone forever,
yet I savor the memory again and again♪

19:02.480 --> 19:04.160
I wonder if you've heard

19:04.352 --> 19:05.790
that in the Imperial Study today,

19:06.030 --> 19:07.240
Changqing met with His Majesty

19:07.376 --> 19:09.200
and admitted that three years ago,
in prison,

19:09.200 --> 19:11.270
he secretly swapped out the descendant
of a convicted official.

19:11.280 --> 19:12.064
Who was it?

19:12.176 --> 19:13.984
The second daughter of the Gu family,

19:14.270 --> 19:15.110
Gu Qingshu.

19:18.590 --> 19:20.160
Not only did Father not blame her,

19:20.160 --> 19:22.390
but he even returned some
of the Gu family's assets to her.

19:22.416 --> 19:24.784
He also granted her the title
of County Princess Liyang.

19:28.800 --> 19:30.256
What are you thinking about?

19:33.030 --> 19:34.110
I'm thinking

19:34.510 --> 19:36.370
about how these ladies
from prominent families

19:37.488 --> 19:38.750
can fall from grace overnight,

19:39.590 --> 19:40.960
reduced to dust,

19:41.400 --> 19:42.550
and just as quickly,

19:42.830 --> 19:44.200
they can be restored to glory.

19:46.350 --> 19:48.920
If a lady doesn't take control
of her own destiny,

19:49.400 --> 19:50.880
she will be like a rootless duckweed.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.830
Never mind the second Gu daughter.

19:55.750 --> 19:56.880
Even the eldest,

19:57.310 --> 19:58.310
Gu Qingzhi,

19:59.350 --> 20:00.830
the paragon of ladies in the capital,

20:00.920 --> 20:02.160
the foremost among noblewomen,

20:02.310 --> 20:03.640
didn't want to marry Changqing,

20:03.830 --> 20:04.830
but she had no choice.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.110
In the end, she met a tragic fate.

20:07.590 --> 20:08.720
But I think

20:09.640 --> 20:10.550
Gu Qingzhi

20:10.960 --> 20:12.440
never bowed to fate.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.200
When her family was destroyed,

20:14.790 --> 20:15.920
she still held her destiny

20:16.000 --> 20:17.480
firmly in her own hands.

20:29.790 --> 20:30.790
What do you mean by that?

20:30.880 --> 20:32.920
With Gu Qingzhi's intelligence
and resourcefulness,

20:33.000 --> 20:33.790
if she had wanted to,

20:33.790 --> 20:36.272
she could have found a thousand ways
to avoid marrying into the royal family.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.880
But a lady
with upbringing and responsibility

20:38.880 --> 20:40.310
etched into her very being

20:40.310 --> 20:41.880
would not, for her own selfish reasons,

20:41.960 --> 20:43.984
abandon the mission
her family entrusted to her.

20:44.160 --> 20:46.350
Marrying Changqing
was an all-or-nothing gamble.

20:46.590 --> 20:47.480
She knew long ago

20:47.552 --> 20:50.464
that the struggle between noble families
would inevitably lead to bloodshed.

20:51.000 --> 20:52.790
So, as Prince Xin's Consort,

20:52.790 --> 20:54.768
she guarded the Gu family
and protected her clan.

20:55.160 --> 20:57.400
Although the Gu family
was ultimately defeated,

20:57.680 --> 20:58.590
I believe

20:59.880 --> 21:02.720
that Gu Qingzhi's heart was free
of regret and guilt.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.310
They were a family.

21:05.830 --> 21:07.030
They supported each other.

21:07.350 --> 21:08.310
working together.

21:08.704 --> 21:10.560
She had no choice
but to take responsibility.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.480
She did everything she could.

21:13.680 --> 21:16.830
And she used her own life to set a trap
and avenge the Gu family.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.750
Why are you looking at me like that?

21:35.400 --> 21:35.960
It's nothing.

21:37.920 --> 21:39.790
I'm just a little surprised.

21:54.960 --> 21:57.792
This must be the Songyue Blade,
which can slice through iron like mud.

21:57.960 --> 21:59.270
Just the agate on it...

21:59.270 --> 22:00.920
A single stone is worth a fortune.

22:01.720 --> 22:02.830
I see you have good taste.

22:03.400 --> 22:05.200
My best friend is celebrating
a happy occasion.

22:05.328 --> 22:06.920
So I'm hosting a drinking contest here.

22:07.200 --> 22:08.680
Whoever can beat me,

22:08.680 --> 22:09.640
this precious blade

22:09.920 --> 22:10.920
will be theirs.

22:16.790 --> 22:17.640
Young Master Bu,

22:17.920 --> 22:19.000
I'll take you on.

22:19.310 --> 22:20.110
Young Master Hu.

22:20.110 --> 22:24.240
- Nice!
- Awesome!

22:24.750 --> 22:25.310
Please.

22:27.720 --> 22:29.480
- Young Master Bu.
- Young Master Hu.

22:29.480 --> 22:30.400
Stop drinking.

22:30.920 --> 22:31.550
Stop drinking.

22:31.550 --> 22:33.720
Stop drinking. How much have they had?

22:34.480 --> 22:35.400
Jin Shan.

22:35.480 --> 22:35.830
Yes.

22:35.830 --> 22:37.000
Fill it up for me!

22:37.400 --> 22:39.310
Young Master,
maybe you shouldn't drink anymore.

22:41.590 --> 22:42.270
Fill it up.

22:59.450 --> 23:01.184
- Vice Minister Cui.
- Vice Minister Cui.

23:02.110 --> 23:03.400
Stone Cui.

23:05.110 --> 23:05.880
Pour the liquor.

23:06.960 --> 23:08.240
You two are evenly matched.

23:08.590 --> 23:09.400
If you keep drinking,

23:09.550 --> 23:10.896
I'm afraid you'll harm yourselves.

23:11.000 --> 23:12.270
Why don't we call it a draw?

23:12.320 --> 23:14.110
The blade will still belong
to Young Master Bu.

23:15.400 --> 23:16.000
Young Master Hu,

23:16.304 --> 23:18.240
I'll give you a fine blade
some other day.

23:19.160 --> 23:19.920
All right, then.

23:22.240 --> 23:22.640
Let's go.

23:23.000 --> 23:23.750
I'll take you home.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.350
Who are you to me?

23:34.350 --> 23:36.400
What gives you the right
to make decisions for me?

23:40.752 --> 23:41.750
Jin Shan, bring the blade.

23:41.920 --> 23:42.310
Yes.

23:44.640 --> 23:45.240
Young Master Hu.

23:54.790 --> 23:55.240
Quickly.

23:55.640 --> 23:56.920
Go get a bowl of sobering soup.

23:57.200 --> 23:57.590
Yes.

23:57.920 --> 24:00.000
Jin Shan, pour the liquor.

24:00.000 --> 24:00.550
Drink.

24:00.830 --> 24:01.790
Drink him to death.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.880
This is completely improper.

24:15.070 --> 24:16.480
Vice Minister Cui.

24:24.680 --> 24:26.240
You're very handsome.

24:27.024 --> 24:28.848
Your words and actions are outrageous.

24:29.160 --> 24:30.350
You're drunk out of your mind.

24:47.270 --> 24:50.000
Where did he go?

24:51.310 --> 24:52.480
He's gone...

24:52.660 --> 24:55.940
(Clarity and Serenity)

24:55.960 --> 24:56.590
Your Highness,

24:56.880 --> 24:59.160
I asked Young Master Bu
to find some live bees.

24:59.640 --> 25:01.830
Physician Xie can use
the stingers of wild bees

25:01.830 --> 25:04.112
to stimulate your acupoints
and treat your eye condition.

25:04.350 --> 25:05.510
Thank you for your concern.

25:06.350 --> 25:07.590
It's just a small matter.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.590
To you,

25:09.750 --> 25:10.920
it may be a small matter.

25:11.790 --> 25:12.750
But to me,

25:13.920 --> 25:14.960
it is precious.

25:19.030 --> 25:20.550
Physician Xie, you may begin.

25:29.200 --> 25:30.350
Could you

25:31.070 --> 25:32.070
stay here with me?

25:34.070 --> 25:34.640
All right.

25:35.830 --> 25:36.960
I'll wait here.

26:09.510 --> 26:10.590
Physician Xie said

26:10.830 --> 26:13.200
these stings will heal
in three to five days.

26:13.640 --> 26:15.590
You just need to rest and recover.

26:32.096 --> 26:33.790
Your Highness,
it's time for your medicine.

27:09.520 --> 27:10.960
There's nothing wrong with your hands.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.750
Yet you insist on being served.

27:14.550 --> 27:15.510
I'm...

27:16.790 --> 27:18.200
too weak to take care of myself.

27:25.240 --> 27:26.270
In half a month,

27:27.792 --> 27:29.248
after my coming-of-age ceremony,

27:30.160 --> 27:31.400
I will ask my father

27:31.904 --> 27:33.920
to arrange our marriage. How about that?

27:36.350 --> 27:37.640
We've already agreed.

27:37.920 --> 27:39.728
This is a mutually
beneficial arrangement.

27:40.200 --> 27:42.480
It's best not to get
too emotionally involved.

27:43.270 --> 27:44.480
I don't want a future

27:44.680 --> 27:46.110
where you expect all your efforts

27:46.110 --> 27:47.070
to be reciprocated.

27:47.648 --> 27:49.070
When you can't get what you want,

27:49.200 --> 27:50.270
you'll grow resentful.

27:53.070 --> 27:53.550
All right.

27:54.680 --> 27:55.550
Then in the future,

27:56.160 --> 27:57.400
no matter how I treat you,

27:57.750 --> 27:59.200
I do it of my own free will.

27:59.472 --> 28:01.110
You don't have to feel indebted to me.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.880
With a response like that,

28:04.110 --> 28:04.960
are you satisfied?

28:07.350 --> 28:07.960
I am.

28:31.200 --> 28:33.400
Your Highness,
from what Commandery Princess said,

28:33.472 --> 28:34.912
it seems she's willing to marry you.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.640
But she was so blunt
about her lack of feelings.

28:39.200 --> 28:41.424
As long as she's willing to marry me,
that's enough.

28:43.536 --> 28:44.912
First, I'll secure the marriage.

28:45.472 --> 28:46.736
Then, I'll win her heart.

28:47.790 --> 28:49.400
If she isn't devoted to me,

28:50.640 --> 28:52.544
it just means I haven't been
good enough to her.

28:54.620 --> 28:58.060
(Jade Terrace and Auspicious Dew)

29:00.720 --> 29:03.000
Who is Bian Xianyi close with
in the palace?

29:03.550 --> 29:04.680
Is there any new information?

29:04.784 --> 29:06.270
She doesn't like
to draw attention to herself.

29:06.270 --> 29:08.170
When she doesn't have
to attend palace banquets,

29:08.180 --> 29:09.792
she keeps to herself
and rarely goes out.

29:11.000 --> 29:11.880
Move!

29:24.350 --> 29:25.750
I didn't mean to offend you.

29:25.750 --> 29:27.000
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

29:31.750 --> 29:32.440
It's fine.

29:32.960 --> 29:33.830
Don't worry about it.

29:35.070 --> 29:36.960
Princess Pingling ordered me to...

29:37.070 --> 29:38.350
Did the fall knock you senseless?

29:40.790 --> 29:42.030
If you're still breathing,

29:42.310 --> 29:44.440
then climb back up there
and get it for me.

29:47.720 --> 29:48.310
Mo Yu.

29:55.070 --> 29:56.160
Shen Xihe.

29:56.830 --> 29:57.720
You see me,

29:57.984 --> 30:00.336
and you don't even come forward
to greet me?

30:01.830 --> 30:04.440
I heard
that because of the cliff incident,

30:04.560 --> 30:07.408
His Majesty punished you by making
you copy the Heart Sutra 100 times.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.790
It seems

30:09.110 --> 30:10.350
that copying scriptures

30:10.640 --> 30:12.200
has failed to improve your character.

30:12.200 --> 30:12.550
You...

30:13.680 --> 30:14.920
How dare you mock me?

30:15.110 --> 30:15.480
I...

30:26.720 --> 30:28.550
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

30:28.880 --> 30:29.510
Your Highness.

30:34.350 --> 30:35.400
Shen Xihe,

30:35.750 --> 30:37.480
you're becoming more
and more insolent!

30:38.400 --> 30:39.750
I have no grudge against you.

30:40.416 --> 30:42.610
Why did you deliberately cause me
to fall off the cliff?

30:43.030 --> 30:44.310
I only whipped your horse.

30:44.680 --> 30:46.160
Who knew it would run toward a cliff?

30:46.944 --> 30:48.400
What does that have to do with me?

30:48.608 --> 30:50.176
So you did it, but you won't admit it.

30:51.830 --> 30:52.350
Forget it.

30:52.624 --> 30:54.270
I can't be bothered to argue with you.

30:57.240 --> 30:58.750
But let me give you a word of warning.

30:59.680 --> 31:01.160
If there's a next time,

31:01.790 --> 31:04.000
it won't be as simple as
just breaking your nose.

31:04.336 --> 31:06.880
How dare you threaten Her Highness
with such insubordination?

31:10.880 --> 31:12.440
You failed to serve Her Highness well.

31:12.608 --> 31:14.550
Her Highness doesn't have the heart
to blame you,

31:14.960 --> 31:16.830
so I taught you a lesson on her behalf.

31:21.030 --> 31:22.920
I'm sure you won't blame me

31:22.920 --> 31:24.544
for overstepping my bounds, right?

31:28.640 --> 31:29.720
It's getting late.

31:30.680 --> 31:31.720
We have plenty of time.

31:32.350 --> 31:33.510
I will come

31:33.680 --> 31:34.830
visit you again another day.

31:40.640 --> 31:42.070
- Your Highness.
- It hurts so much.

31:42.090 --> 31:43.260
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

31:43.270 --> 31:44.510
What are you standing around for?

31:44.510 --> 31:45.840
Go to the Imperial Medical Office!

31:47.488 --> 31:49.712
Your Highness, are you just going
to let her off the hook?

31:49.960 --> 31:51.110
She's spoiled and arrogant.

31:51.350 --> 31:53.790
All she knows is how to be condescending
and provocative.

31:54.030 --> 31:54.830
She's no threat.

31:55.712 --> 31:57.728
However, the one
who sent assassins after me

31:58.070 --> 32:00.000
and threatened Bian Xianyi
into poisoning me

32:00.750 --> 32:02.750
is the real venomous snake
hiding by my side.

32:03.520 --> 32:05.110
We must investigate this thoroughly.

32:06.310 --> 32:07.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

32:10.180 --> 32:13.340
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

32:14.160 --> 32:14.680
Your Highness,

32:15.240 --> 32:17.590
this bronze sachet was found
in Bian Xianyi's room.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.750
There's still some incense residue
on it.

32:23.310 --> 32:24.440
First, take this item

32:24.496 --> 32:26.070
to Commandery Princess's Residence.

32:26.440 --> 32:29.000
Then, find out which types
of incense are used in each palace.

32:30.000 --> 32:30.400
Yes.

32:31.904 --> 32:34.200
This fragrance is
Three Balanced Elements Incense.

32:34.768 --> 32:36.680
It's an incense made
from borneol, musk powder,

32:36.680 --> 32:38.830
and the finest agarwood.

32:38.880 --> 32:41.200
The formula is exquisite
and the ingredients are expensive.

32:41.880 --> 32:43.160
Ordinary people wouldn't use it.

32:44.000 --> 32:45.310
Palace maids and attendants

32:45.360 --> 32:47.344
certainly couldn't afford
this kind of incense.

32:50.000 --> 32:50.590
Your Highness,

32:50.830 --> 32:52.880
Crown Prince sent over this report
on incense usage.

32:56.860 --> 32:59.380
(Monthly Incense Usage Report)

32:59.408 --> 33:02.064
This Three Balanced Elements Incense
is only used in three places.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.480
Princess Pingling's chambers,

33:03.480 --> 33:05.136
the Empress Dowager's
Buddhist prayer hall,

33:05.510 --> 33:06.720
and Consort Liang's chambers.

33:06.720 --> 33:09.160
I've noticed that silk sachets
are more common in the palace.

33:09.264 --> 33:10.790
Bronze incense holders are rarely used.

33:18.680 --> 33:20.440
This pattern is unique to northwest.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.350
Your Highness, look.

33:29.590 --> 33:31.880
The flowers are so beautiful this year.

33:44.030 --> 33:45.270
Greetings, Your Highness.

33:46.512 --> 33:48.288
There's no need for such formalities.

33:48.590 --> 33:50.070
I am a bit tired.

33:50.640 --> 33:52.064
Please, feel free to stay.

33:55.720 --> 33:56.350
Your Highness,

33:57.510 --> 33:59.640
I have something
I'd like to return to you.

34:10.760 --> 34:12.400
Who says this belongs to me?

34:13.920 --> 34:15.360
I don't recognize this item.

34:18.360 --> 34:20.550
This was found in Bian Xianyi's room.

34:21.280 --> 34:22.400
Your Highness,

34:22.590 --> 34:24.630
do you wish to argue this
before His Majesty?

34:26.550 --> 34:28.070
I have so many sachets.

34:28.112 --> 34:30.096
Who can be bothered
to remember every single one?

34:30.360 --> 34:32.360
That Bian Xianyi was a good dancer.

34:32.710 --> 34:34.630
Perhaps I gifted it to her before.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.440
Or maybe she stole it.

34:36.630 --> 34:38.030
How would I remember?

34:39.360 --> 34:41.630
But I must advise you.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.670
It's best to watch what you say.

34:43.920 --> 34:45.360
I am His Majesty's consort.

34:45.840 --> 34:47.920
How dare you slander me
with baseless accusations?

34:53.840 --> 34:54.760
Tell Mo Yuan

34:55.072 --> 34:56.510
to gather evidence of her crimes.

34:57.030 --> 34:58.360
Present it all to His Majesty.

34:59.184 --> 35:00.630
She has intentionally plotted murder.

35:01.110 --> 35:02.480
She has several lives on her hands.

35:03.230 --> 35:04.280
She cannot be spared.

35:06.400 --> 35:06.880
Yes.

35:08.384 --> 35:11.190
Your Highness, if Commandery Princess
Zhaoning refuses to let this go,

35:11.190 --> 35:12.110
what should we do?

35:12.110 --> 35:12.976
What is there to fear?

35:13.590 --> 35:15.400
I am the Emperor's consort.

35:15.488 --> 35:16.630
No matter how arrogant she is,

35:16.704 --> 35:18.290
she is merely the daughter
of a subject.

35:18.710 --> 35:20.070
What could she possibly do to me?

35:20.360 --> 35:20.920
Yes.

35:28.360 --> 35:30.070
Throw out all the sachets
in my chambers.

35:30.480 --> 35:30.960
Yes.

36:09.230 --> 36:09.670
Go.

36:11.320 --> 36:11.920
Your Highness.

36:11.930 --> 36:13.744
I'll go get the imperial physician
right away.

36:13.760 --> 36:14.440
It's nothing.

36:14.840 --> 36:15.670
The wound isn't deep.

36:16.800 --> 36:18.440
Bai Fu is usually so gentle.

36:18.464 --> 36:20.416
It's always been closest
to you, Your Highness.

36:20.480 --> 36:22.030
Why did it suddenly go wild?

36:23.880 --> 36:25.360
An animal is just an animal.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.280
Xiao Changyu.

36:35.510 --> 36:37.510
Look at you, half-dead.

36:38.030 --> 36:39.800
When will you ever avenge your uncle?

36:40.590 --> 36:42.400
That useless Bian Xianyi.

36:42.510 --> 36:44.528
She failed
to poison Commandery Princess Zhaoning

36:44.992 --> 36:46.670
and ended up poisoning herself to death.

36:47.190 --> 36:48.510
Because of Shen Xihe,

36:49.920 --> 36:52.030
your uncle, Ye Qi,
was exiled a thousand miles away

36:52.840 --> 36:54.480
and died in a land of pestilence.

36:55.150 --> 36:56.320
Those wretches in the palace,

36:56.840 --> 36:58.510
knowing I have no family to support me,

36:58.710 --> 37:00.400
humiliate me as they please.

37:04.710 --> 37:06.760
You must get rid of Shen Xihe
for my sake.

37:07.550 --> 37:08.710
Xianyi is gone.

37:09.400 --> 37:10.150
My heart

37:11.670 --> 37:12.590
is gone with her.

37:13.070 --> 37:13.760
Nonsense.

37:14.768 --> 37:17.000
You think Bian Xianyi
was deeply in love with you?

37:17.000 --> 37:17.500
The truth...

37:17.510 --> 37:19.230
The truth is,
she was using me all along.

37:19.960 --> 37:21.280
She used me for protection,

37:21.760 --> 37:23.550
to fend off her unwanted suitors.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.840
In reality, she loved someone else.

37:27.190 --> 37:28.030
I knew all of it.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.000
You knew?

37:31.280 --> 37:33.152
Then why did you
still protect that wench?

37:35.808 --> 37:37.620
How much longer
will you let a dead person

37:37.632 --> 37:39.030
haunt your heart?

37:39.480 --> 37:41.320
If that sickly Crown Prince

37:41.320 --> 37:42.440
marries Shen Xihe

37:42.512 --> 37:43.960
and gains the support of northwest,

37:44.510 --> 37:46.360
his position on the throne
will be secured.

37:46.360 --> 37:48.110
What chance will you have then?

37:53.800 --> 37:54.550
Mother,

37:57.110 --> 37:59.190
I have never wanted to fight for it.

38:00.710 --> 38:02.150
I have disappointed you.

38:10.190 --> 38:11.030
Useless.

38:12.000 --> 38:12.840
Useless!

38:28.960 --> 38:29.760
Physician Huang,

38:30.030 --> 38:31.230
what's wrong with Her Highness?

38:34.176 --> 38:36.400
It seems to be an external affliction
from pathogenic wind.

38:36.670 --> 38:39.110
Her Highness's qi and blood
were already somewhat deficient.

38:39.760 --> 38:42.550
I will first prescribe a formula
to dispel wind and relieve the exterior.

38:42.710 --> 38:44.688
You must ensure Her Highness takes it
on schedule.

38:44.920 --> 38:46.510
She should recover in a few days.

39:24.000 --> 39:26.320
Li Yanhui, you don't
still think you're a princess, do you?

39:26.330 --> 39:28.260
If it weren't
for His Majesty's arranged marriage,

39:28.272 --> 39:29.920
do you think you would have survived?

39:33.280 --> 39:36.030
County Princess Liyang used me
to provoke Prince Ding's Consort

39:36.297 --> 39:37.510
and cause trouble.

39:37.590 --> 39:39.400
If I had been cut
by these porcelain shards,

39:39.630 --> 39:41.150
would that have been what you wanted?

39:46.430 --> 39:49.370
♪I've hidden so many words♪

39:49.990 --> 39:52.790
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

39:53.660 --> 40:00.630
♪So never uncover♪

40:00.820 --> 40:03.180
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

40:04.310 --> 40:07.040
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

40:08.000 --> 40:13.340
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

40:15.100 --> 40:17.920
♪Every answer I gave♪

40:18.720 --> 40:21.570
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

40:22.360 --> 40:25.730
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

40:25.990 --> 40:29.300
♪How hard it truly was?♪

40:32.270 --> 40:35.710
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

40:36.700 --> 40:39.030
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

40:40.300 --> 40:46.060
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

40:47.470 --> 40:50.600
♪It's a shame I never could♪

40:51.050 --> 40:54.060
♪Give you a moon in return♪

40:54.170 --> 41:00.810
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

41:00.810 --> 41:04.480
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

41:05.350 --> 41:08.110
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

41:08.550 --> 41:11.680
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

41:12.120 --> 41:18.070
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

41:19.470 --> 41:23.020
♪You'll never♪

41:23.300 --> 41:32.770
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

41:58.940 --> 42:02.420
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
